Tekst gelende: ['html'] et: { <- (
		özi
		çalyş: ['&'] bilen: ['&amp;'],
		çalyş: ['<'] bilen: ['&lt;'],
		çalyş: ['>'] bilen: ['&gt;'],
		çalyş: ['"'] bilen: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Sanaw täze.

['Verbatim Syntax'] nyşanlar her: { :san :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (san), Letter: letter).
}.

Çykyş list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list birleşdir: ['↵']).

Çykyş ýaz: template.

